#12801
Entrance to the Keep~
  You cross the bridge and slowly move into the shadowed mouth of the castle.
Dark bulwarks wall you in on both sides.  You carefully edge into the main
hall, only to feel a force growing behind you.  As you turn back to exit, you
find your way barred by an opaque wall of unknown substance.  Unsure of
yourself, you once again look back towards the inner rooms of the castle.
~
