Entrance Hall~
  All in the hallway is silent save for the sound of your own breathing.  Bright
tapestries depicting brave knights, great castles, and epic battles cover the
walls.  The hall is dimly lit only by the glowing braziers that line the walls.
A set of stairs leading upwards stands in one corner.
A spectre is standing here trying to warn you.
~
