E
spectre~
  The spectral image covalesces out of the ether in the room.  It comes toward
you and speaks,  "Halt.  Come no further.  I am Mandrel, High Adept of the
Keep and Master of the 7 Mysteries.  Leave the Keep immediately and do not
return.  It is dangerous for you to stay here.  LEAVE AT ONCE!"

  The apparition looks away from you towards some unseen assailant with a look
of horror growing on his face.  "NO!, The gleaming eyes ... NO, get back (He
writhes as if struck by a great blow), you can't be here so soon.  (He screams
and looks at you again)  Flee, Flee while there is still time.  Flee if you
value your lives."  (He shudders as if from another blow, and sinks screaming
to the ground in a pool of his own spectral blood.)
~
S
#12803
Reception Hall~
  The main reception hall of the Dragonor Keep stands before you.  The edges
of the room are dark with shadows, and the center of the room is covered with
the blood of unknoen combatants.  Several fallen soldiers and initiates lie
on the ground with their dying screams still on their lips.  Their bodies are
badly mangled and cut, many missing arms, pieces of their faces, or central
torsos.  From the center of the room a lone figure floats 15' from the ground
suspended by tendrils of light.  Neck broken and bloody, his clothing marks
him as a full sorcerer, and an adept of the keep.  The source of the light
seems to be a golden key still grasped in the mage's right hand.  You hear a
sound in the darkness and look up.  Glowing red eyes stare back at you.
~
