#12806
Hallway~
  A party of the guard seems to have made its last stand here.  Bodies lie
hacked on the ground, and scars on the walls prove testimony to the fierce
fighting that occurred here.  A lone soldier stands pinned to the wall,
pierced through the stomach by a giant claw.  Dried blood forms a line down
his cheek from a severe wound to his head.  His eyes look vacantly out you as
defient in death as the were in life.  His hand still holds a rune-encrusted
sword that is still sharp and deadly.
~
