To Allister Cullen, preceptor of the Michaeline Order,

     I have come across rumors that the mages led by Mandrel and Bayonne have
been working on creating an artificially created super-fighter.  They just
brought in a new mage by the name of Conchitez, a specialist in summoning, to
the keep.  Combined with Mandrel and Bayonne's skills, they might succeed.  I
believe that they are very close to success now.  We must act quickly if we
are to stand a chance.
                      - Joachim
