E
book~
Conchitez.  Private Log.

  Day 1:  Mandrel gave a general alert.  That can only mean that our pets have
escaped.  Don't think the guard can counter these creatures - Mandrel has kept
them too much in the dark.  Hiding in herbalist lab.  Maybe I can find
something to stop them here.  Filling the room with perfume to hide my scent.
I will observe and record.

  Day 2:  Castle is silent.  Have spotted 2 battle sites - we lost them both.
Thankfully, I haven't been discovered.  It seems that they have taken over the
archives underneath the Keep.  They may be preparing to molt into the stage 3
form.  I hope not.  Mandrel boasted that that was the hyper-intelligent mode.
They might figure out how to harness the powers within the castle to track me.

  Day 3:  There is a sound outside it is growing closer.  Hopefully they will
pass by...  The noises have receded...

     (there are no more entries in the log)
~
