stone~
The Stone glows, and begins to speak:

Mardonius:  Come in and sit down Mandrel.  I prefer to be at ease when I talk
among friends.  What makes these creatures of yours so impressive?

Mandrel:  Let me counter with a question of my own.  What would you do if you
were suddenly attacked by Allister and his Knights?

Mardonius:  I would send scouts out to see what odds I was up against, then I
would fight or evacuate depending on the odds.

Mandrel:  That's exactly why I designed the Dar-grak.  They molt from form to
form, so you never know exactly what you are up against.  Three stages, each
with there own specialties; this makes evaluation difficult.  Defenses against
one may prove useless against another.

Mardonius:  So we create the perfect threat.  Why shouldn't we be terrified of
the prospect?

Mandrel:  That is what I am working on now...
~
