stone~
Entry 1:  Mandrel.  Sigma Code Starfall.  Four batches ready for final testing.
I am informed by Bayonne that Skul is on schedule, but not by much.  Bayonne
is leaving to coordinate work on the other end.  I should have plenty of time
to perfect my creations.

Entry 2:  Progress is on schedule...  batch 1 shows high adaptability...
batch 2 has survival rates over 90%.  We will be on schedule for deployment.
Our enemies will not stand a chance.

  If I am correct - wait a minute, we have fluctuations in the etheric
continuim..  disruption in the containment fields...  all batches showing an
increase in activity.  Countermeasures ineffective.

  The guard is notified... setting up a warning and sealing the keep.  Hope it
is just a precaution.

              (time lapse)

  message completed.  wait... the gleaming eyes.. No, get back... You can't be
here so soon... AAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!!! (end of message)
~
